    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwo i tic pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, wutmera, ro wor pa Were m'oasere riwan, agoyo riwin koko me: Miy win delkwoŋ win ri Were paka cowirok makwo, maleŋ ma sangala go. Meno a lamo ma cuny ma wiripo cwayo rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wiluw kula ma piny me, to bedi win ma wiwire i paro mewin, aka nyaka wibino ŋeyo mito pa Were; gimaber ma sangala go, odoko m'olony kicutho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka gi mic ma nema ma Were omiyan awaco gime ri wijoje: Wikiri wipar ni win malo loyo kama di wipar'iye. Kucel, bedi win milengela i paro mewin, kisi dhano kwoŋ win, ma ripo gi yeyo ma Were omiyo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 12:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanitie g'adec madit i del acel, aka adec me je nitie gi tic mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno kada wathothi, je fodi wabedo del acel i Kristo, aka wamakere kanyacel paka adec m'opokere opokere ma del acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.12.4+1CO.12.5+1CO.12.6+1CO.12.7+1CO.12.8+1CO.12.9+1CO.12.10+1CO.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 12:4-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo paka wanitie gi mic m'opokere opokere cungo kwoŋ nema ma Were omiyo wan, weyi waori ama: K'obedo mic ma tuco mikwenda ma wok bongi Were, tim ameno cungo kwoŋ yeyo m'inigine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'obedo mic ma cwayo, tiyi ri jowotin; k'obedo mic ma fonji, fonji wadin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'obedo mic ma medo wadin miseni, tim ameno; ŋata poko ri joman gima go nitie gine, wopok gi cunye maber; jatel, wotiy gi meni; jawor, wonyuthi wadi wor gi kisangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mar ripo bedo mar'adieri. Kwer gimarac, cwire kwoŋ gimaber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mare win gi owirok ma cuny paka wutmere i Kristo, odoko bedi win mayil i miyo jowoti win dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyi win matek, aka wikiri wibedi manyap. Cway win ri Rwoth gi cuny win je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi geno mewin womiy win kisangala, diy win cuny win i teko mewin, aka kway win Were hongo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pok win ye lim mewin gi wutmin win ma jocando, odoko weyi win pecin mewin thwolo ri wendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 5:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.6.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 6:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kway win Were womiy joma lwenyo kodi win silwany; ey, kway wi go womiy jo silwany makiweno kwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sangala win gi joma sangala, ywak win gi joma ywak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agec 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuthi win dhano je cuny maber marom. Wikiri wibedi jokwoto, to joli win tic kada ma piny. Wikiri wibedi gi paro ni wiriek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro otimo riwin marac, wikiri wicul kwor. Tem win timo gima ji je tero ni ber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tem win paka nyalere neno ni wibedo i siem gi ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 32:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wicul kwor wiwegi, jowotan; kucel weyi win keme pa Were ama woculi. Kole ndiko waco ni, “Rwoth waco ni, ‘Culo kwor obedo aparan; abino culo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.25.21+PRO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agec 25:21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel ndiko waco ni, “Ka jakwor perin kec neko, pidhi go; ka riyo neko, miy go gir'amadha; kole k'itimo ameno, meno cal pa onyo itoko cuk mac malieth i wiye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'iyey reco wodhumin; kucel loy reco gi bero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
